{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2b07d5d1-bac0-8c05-bacf-30324be5282c",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T13:13:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:12:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:12:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Kevin. My name is Yusuf Goldberg. I'm calling about a crosswalk near my house, at 253 Callender Avenue. The paint has faded, almost gone, and cars do not stop for people crossing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 253 Callender, North End. So the crosswalk lines are worn off and drivers aren't yielding. Is it right in front of your place or down the street a bit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in front, or, to be exact, about twenty feet to the left of my driveway as you face the street. I noticed it getting bad in November, so about three months now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put in a request for repainting and have someone take a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:12:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And a second question. If a car gets damaged on a bad road, does the city reimburse the owner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:13:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's usually a claim process, and it depends on the situation. I can give you the office that handles claims if you need it. For a crosswalk, though, that's not really a car damage thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:13:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that's a general question. Not for this. And how long do repairs usually take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:13:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly it varies. Winter slows paint work down, since it needs warmer, dry weather. Could be a few weeks, could be spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Forgive me if I'm hard to understand. My accent gets heavier when I'm tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:13:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine, I got everything. Callender Avenue, faded crosswalk, twenty feet left of your driveway. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:13:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all. Thank you, Kevin. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:13:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Goldberg. Take care."
    }
  ],
